{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Post-workout summary hero chip: 'Biggest workout ever' / 'Biggest this month' (T180). Implemented by biggestWorkoutBadge on Android and GymBiggestWorkout.badge on iPhone; both must produce identical results.",
  "rules": [
    "1. Input is the set of workouts strictly earlier than the finished one (same date -> smaller id/stored order is earlier; the caller decides that) plus the finished workout. Each has a date (epoch ms) and a volume = sum of weight x reps over its sets (bodyweight 0 kg adds 0).",
    "2. A finished workout with volume <= 0 never gets a chip (expected null).",
    "3. 'ever': at least 3 earlier workouts AND the finished volume is strictly greater than the volume of every earlier workout.",
    "4. 'month': otherwise, among earlier workouts whose date falls in the same calendar year+month as the finished workout in the given time zone (the device local zone in the app), at least 2 AND the finished volume is strictly greater than each of them. Workouts of other months or other years do not count and are not compared.",
    "5. Never both: 'ever' wins when both hold. Otherwise null (no chip).",
    "6. Volumes are compared with a 1e-9 tolerance: a difference of 1e-9 or less is a tie (not greater).",
    "7. Display (identical on both platforms): ever -> en 'Biggest workout ever' / uk 'Найбільший обсяг за весь час' / ru 'Самый большой объём за всё время'; month -> en 'Biggest this month' / uk 'Найбільший обсяг цього місяця' / ru 'Самый большой объём в этом месяце'. A flat tonal capsule with a trophy icon on the hero card, shown after the level-up pill."
  ],
  "inputFields": {
    "timeZone": "IANA zone id used for the calendar month",
    "earlier": "workouts earlier than the finished one: id, date (epoch ms), volume",
    "current": "the finished workout: date (epoch ms), volume"
  },
  "outputField": "expected: 'ever' | 'month' | null",
